</hi><seg source="#source-7891-7906">）帝国　（</seg><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-7906-7937" corresp="#source-7908-7937"><seg source="#source-7906-7908">20</seg></hi><seg source="#source-7937-7949">）赤　（</seg><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-7949-7980" corresp="#source-7951-7980"><seg source="#source-7949-7951">21</seg></hi><seg source="#source-7980-7992">）赤　（</seg><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-7992-8023" corresp="#source-7994-8023"><seg source="#source-7992-7994">22</seg></hi><seg source="#source-8023-8058">）日本ソヴェート共和国</seg></p>
